+# Aegis Legal Delegation Manifest Template
+
+Purpose
+- Template for recording legal delegation to Aegis automation for a set of actions. This manifest is intended to be
+  completed by Legal, signed (multi-party cosign/HSM), stored in WORM evidence, and recorded in Vault.
+
+Fields
+- delegation_id: unique id (string)
+- delegated_to: party/entity receiving delegation (string)
+- delegated_by: legal authority signer (string)
+- actions: list of action keys (e.g., deploy_low_risk, finance_autoblock)
+- scope: textual description of scope and constraints (string)
+- evidence_requirements: list of required evidentiary items (sbom, attestation, reproducibility)
+- expiry: ISO 8601 timestamp for expiry of delegation
+- insurance_reference: policy identifier / binder (string)
+- created_at: ISO timestamp
+- notes: free text
+
+Example
+```json
+{
+  "delegation_id": "delegation-2026-01-01-ops",
+  "delegated_to": "Aegis Automation v1.4",
+  "delegated_by": "Acme Legal Dept",
+  "actions": ["deploy_low_risk","rollback_production"],
+  "scope": "Automated promotion of non-billing infra and rollback of failed canaries",
+  "evidence_requirements": ["sbom","attestation_bundle","reproducibility_report"],
